    "chapterId": 117,
    "fileId": 500,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Acinar cystic transformation</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Unilocular acinar cystic transformation is characterized by 1&ndash;2&nbsp;cell layers of acinar epithelium with little intervening ductal epithelium and an underlying hyalinized wall.</p>",
    "source": "Aatur D. Singhi",
    "copyright": "",
